+this section owns the corrected technical relation.
+
+The immutable admitted Program opts in through
+`policies["abg.default_library_fulfillment"]`. Its original input contains the
+matching closed source context, RequirementTerms, existing
+GtlContractFulfillmentBindings, SemanticProofPolicies/Shapes and subordinate
+completeness selection. Initial source spans bind exact protected original bytes.
+The default library's existing root remains GovernanceWorkState. No semantic-job
+root, stage order, ledger, event kind or new graph operator is introduced.
+Programs without this profile retain the earlier S5 relation. Selected missing,
+foreign or malformed contracts refuse; payload shape never activates the profile.
+
+The ordinary Executive judgment may propose additional requirements using local
+candidate refs, exact source quotes, existing policy templates, predecessor refs
+and actual evidence. The owner derives source spans and task-scoped identities;
+original and admitted new obligations remain conserved. The choice projection
+retains additions in selected child input. A gap retains unresolved original/new
+refs and the actual admitted synthesis Result, whose raw proposal and conserved
+source support the same derivation; it cannot lose additions by returning early.
+No worker can emit trusted coverage, remove an obligation or grant authority.
+
+The independent assessment uses one **immutable installed structural schema**.
+Current obligation/policy/shape/evidence domains are supplied by owned task
+context and checked by the same selected-profile binder, never inserted as
+runtime enums into schema-asset bytes. Raw F_P selects prior Result refs, semantic
+roles, artifact paths and command ids; it never emits integrity hashes, CCall or
+actor identities, or its own future Result. At the actual retained assessment
+fold, ABG attaches the real child Result/CCall/actor and derives exact integrity
+coordinates from admitted evidence. Negative and indeterminate semantic findings
+remain admitted and leave obligations open. Malformed/crossed references refuse.
+
+The native-work after-context and C2 protected snapshots supply artifact facts;
+C2 command observations supply execution facts. Supplied files need no invented
+author. Pairing checks compatible actual **outer** native/C2 output contracts;
+the inner consumer assessment contract is separately checked by the existing
+native assessment/schema owner. Meaning and sufficiency of realization/verifier
+roles belong to the independent F_P judgment; total checks enforce exact separate
+selected subjects, current dependency bytes and actor independence. A native
+report is never admitted verifier execution.
+
+The selected strength rule checks declared evidence roles, exact current support
+and independent assessment, plus only prospectively required adverse-command
+conditions. `adverseEvidenceRefs` explicitly select historical admitted C2
+observations for those conditions. Their old dependency bytes are retained as
+historical counterevidence; they are not required to equal current corrected
+bytes and never substitute for current realization/execution support. No policy
+prose is interpreted as executable law. Depth/applicability/discovery completeness
+uses explicit selected rows with attributed F_P judgments and total domain and
+support checks. Unsupported rules/enumeration remain typed policy gaps.
+
+Existing native child fold produces compact support facts once from its already
+computed retained source. There is no per-support history scan or new cache.
+Existing indexed Results and authenticated invocation/workspace coordinates
+resolve explicit references. Internal owners consume bound immutable facts;
+only new derived identities are computed. Relevant physical changes stale affected
+coverage while conserving unaffected support. Historical replay consumes admitted
+contexts/snapshots and explicit command environment, not mutable files or ambient
+process defaults.
+
+The existing parent evaluation requires both its current independent UAT relation
+and eligible per-obligation coverage, selected depth/policy completeness and
+strength, with no unresolved obligation/gap. Scalar success cannot bypass these
+checks. The existing recurse application preserves state and requires parent
+reevaluation. F_P alone selects new work; F_D neither ranks nor schedules it.
+
+S6 uses unchanged full original source/oracle and a prospectively frozen consumer
+case. Its authored execution plan is independently assessed against fixed declared
+commands; it is not secretly their runtime source. One same-lineage baseline
+failure and consequential correction, actual fresh lifecycle assets, current
+execution, independent assessment and fresh Public reads are required. Mechanical
+readiness is not native qualification, and S5 evidence is reused only for its
+unchanged claims.
